  "releaseNotes": "21.0.0\n* Stream overloads for every PdfUtils method (CountPages, ExtractText*, ExtractAttachments, CanMerge, CanExtract, Merge, ExtractPage(s), AddAttachment)\n* Writing path overloads no longer leave a truncated output file behind on error\n* Fixed XMP extension schema namespace for ZUGFeRD 2.0: PDFs saved with Version20 pass PDF/A validation again\n* NuGet README added\n* Updated dependency to core library 21.0.0",
